DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ddwwmmmmcc driver provides support for various MMC/SD/SDIO controllers
     based on the Synopsys DesignWare SD/eMMC core.  These controllers are
     typically found on SoCs, such as the Rockchip RK3288/RK3399 and Samsung
     Exynos ARM SoCs.

     The sdmmc(4) subsystem performs SD/MMC transactions to communicate with
     whatever MMC/SD/SDIO devices are inserted into the card slot or directly
     connected to the controller.

